// The .exe's icon, and nothing else — the same icon as the receiver's, by path rather
// than by copy, so there is one .ico to regenerate when castaway-icon.svg changes (see
// crates/app/assets/README.md). No manifest, for the app's reason: nix/windows.nix
// stages manifests externally, and an embedded one would silently replace it.
1 ICON "../../app/assets/castaway.ico"
